#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "These functions calculate the complex hyperbolic cosine of I<z>."
msgstr "Funkcje te zwracają cosinus hiperboliczny liczby zespolonej I<z>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "The complex hyperbolic cosine function is defined as:"
msgstr ""
"Funkcja cosinusa hiperbolicznego liczb zespolonych jest zdefiniowana jako:"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "ccosh(z) = (exp(z)+exp(-z))/2\n"
msgstr "ccosh(z) = (exp(z)+exp(-z))/2\n"

